nc_ohc=drygGJYJ1UoQ7kNvwFZ01yB&_nc_oc=Adr_a3NoGEntBKjJm4XgLSDLYfmkB8iuFeCwQvFDxJLM1HRUcDJiI5Y1hjnsz3saAt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWJLv6o2n8263mVRqSwt56yuV_R5Hlovrrf3VmWrJYPfw&oe=6B105123"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameCover.png", "id": "1095354413400949", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/822999411_1095354416734282_3388193694296437782_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q8L7EirqhNoQ7kNvwHsCQC4&_nc_oc=AdqGsZFUy0l48hrxrtzcZ9EmA7lCetysavLEQwWvEOlp81-iMbCPZqwMg-jVsNvm2Fs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUniM8KPR85GK_Ecg3izQf2FfosKAJ_xZ0wbZYrFMWjjw&oe=6B1039DE"}, "display_name": "Prison Break", "keywords": ["prison", "jail", "jailbreak", "prisonlife", "escape"], "long_description": "**Lights out is at ten. You won\u2019t be here for it.**\n\nThe bell rings at six. Roll call in the cafeteria, then off to your shift  while a guard watches the door. Keep your head down. Eat your lunch. Shoot some hoops in the yard.\n\nAnd all day long, work on your plan.\n\n{1798606758075244}\n\nMaybe it\u2019s the keycard you lifted off a guard who got too close. Maybe it\u2019s a loose panel deep in the vents, or the sewer under your feet, or a borrowed set of nurse\u2019s scrubs and a truly terrible disguise. Some ways out aren\u2019t written down anywhere. You\u2019ll have to find those yourself.\n\n{2403521723722530}\n\nOr wear the badge.\n\nKeep Penville State Prison in line. Search pockets, snap on the cuffs, keep your taser close. When an alarm goes off across town, key your radio, jump in the squad car and floor it.\n\n{977014598337418}\n\nOver the wall, the real fun starts.\n\nMake it out and you\u2019re a wanted criminal loose in a town that never saw you coming. Hit the corner store. Slip past the lasers and crack the bank vault. Lie low at the scrapyard hideout, then roll back up to the gate and bust your friends out.\n\nUp to twelve players share each server. Inmates plotting together, cops working the radio, the friend who swore they\u2019d come back for you.\n\n{1150996050942165}", "short_description": "Escape the State Prison, or keep it under control as a cop. Plot elaborate breakouts, explore a criminal underworld, rob banks, and bust your friends out. With multiple escape routes, police pursuits, and up to 12 players per server, every day is a fight for freedom - or order."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/prisonbreakprivacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Piglet Midwest", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/prisonbreakprivacypolicy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1482612648266929"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "956336947255298"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "956336947255298"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794416460, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "956336947255298"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1507765175751676", "version": "1.7"}, "id": "2311465902982183", "chan